{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2022-03-14 07:30:00', 'title': 'ROLLINS, INC. RECEIVES SIXTH-CONSECUTIVE TOP WORKPLACES AWARD FROM THE ATLANTA JOURNAL-CONSTITUTION', 'text': 'ATLANTA, MARCH 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ROLLINS, INC. (NYSE: ROL), A PREMIER GLOBAL CONSUMER AND COMMERCIAL SERVICES COMPANY, HAS BEEN AWARDED A 2022 TOP WORKPLACES AWARD BY THE ATLANTA JOURNAL-CONSTITUTION. ROLLINS RANKED 17TH IN THE LARGE BUSINESS CATEGORY, AND THIS IS THE SIXTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR ROLLINS HAS RECEIVED THE ILLUSTRIOUS AWARD.'}